put[type=submit] {\n    padding:5px 15px; \n    font-weight:bold;\n    background:#eee; \n    border:1px solid #ccc;\n    cursor:pointer;\n    border-radius: 5px; \n}\nlabel {\n \tfont-weight: bold;\n\tmargin: .5em 0 0 0;\n}\nlabel.normal {\n\tfont-weight: normal;\n\tmargin: 0 0 .5em .5em;\n\twidth: 30em;\n\tvertical-align: top;\n}\ninput#submit {\n\tmargin: 1em;\n}\ninput[type=submit] {\n    padding: 5px 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    background: #666;\n    border: 1px solid #666;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n}\n.topSpace {\n\tmargin-top: 1em;\n}\narticle p, p {\n\tpadding-bottom: 0;\n\tmargin-bottom: .5em;\n}\np.aboveForm {\n\tpadding-bottom: 0;\n\tmargin-bottom: 1em;\n}\n.section legend span {\n\tcolor: #BF1722;\n\tfloat: none;\n\tfont-size: 1.5em;\n\tline-height: 1;\n\tmargin-top: 0.2em;\n\tvertical-align: middle;\n}\n.section legend {\n\tfont-size: 1em;\n\tfont-weight: bold;\n\tmargin-top: 1em;\n}\n\n</style>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 9]>\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://html5shiv.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/html5.js\"></script>\n<![endif]-->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async=\"\" src=\"https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net/pagead/viewthroughconversion/1069381703/?random=1774677534010&amp;cv=11&amp;fst=1774677534010&amp;bg=ffffff&amp;guid=ON&amp;async=1&amp;en=gtag.config&amp;gtm=45je63p1v899903185za200zd899903185xec&amp;gcd=13l3l3l3l1l1&amp;dma=0&amp;tag_exp=0~115938465~115938469~117266401~117384405~117484252&amp;u_w=1080&amp;u_h=600&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwebaim.org%2Ftraining%2Fdocs%2Fscholarship&amp;frm=0&amp;tiba=WebAIM%3A%20Scholarship%20Program%20for%20WebAIM's%20Accessible%20Documents%20Course&amp;hn=www.googleadservices.com&amp;npa=0&amp;pscdl=noapi&amp;auid=1598495543.1774677300&amp;uaa=x86&amp;uab=64&amp;uafvl=Chromium%3B145.0.7632.6%7CNot%253AA-Brand%3B99.0.0.0&amp;uamb=0&amp;uam=&amp;uap=Linux&amp;uapv=&amp;uaw=0&amp;data=event%3Dgtag.config&amp;rfmt=3&amp;fmt=4\"></script></head>\n<body>\n\n\n<div id=\"headcontainer\" class=\"clearfix\" style=\"background-image: url(/media/banners/online.jpg)\">\n<header>\n\t<div id=\"skiptocontent\"><a href=\"#maincontent\">skip to main content</a></div>\n\t\n\t<h2><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility In Mind\"></a></h2>\n\n\t<nav>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"hidden\">Main Navigation</h2>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/articles/\">Articles</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/community/\">Community</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</nav>\n\t<div id=\"search\">\n\t\t<form method=\"get\" role=\"search\" action=\"/search/\" id=\"sitesearch\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"search\"><span><label for=\"q\">Search:</label> <input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" id=\"q\"><input type=\"image\" src=\"/media/template/search.svg\" alt=\"Submit Search\"></span></p>\n\t\t</form>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"intro\"><a href=\"/intro\">Introduction to Web Accessibility</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"training\"><a href=\"/services/training\">WebAIM Training</a></p>\n\t</div>\n\n</header>\n</div>\n\n<main id=\"maincontainer\" class=\"clearfix\">\n\n<article id=\"maincontent\">\n\n<h1>Scholarship Program for WebAIM's Accessible Documents Course</h1>\n\n<p id=\"breadcrumbs\"><span class=\"hidden\">You are here: </span><a href=\"/\">Home</a> &gt; <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a> &gt; <a href=\"/services/training/#online\">Accessibility Training</a> &gt; <a href=\"https://webaim.org/training/docs/\">Accessible Documents: Word, PowerPoint, &amp; Acrobat</a> &gt; Scholarship Program</p>\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.5.2/css/bootstrap.min.css\">\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n\t\n\n<p>Since 2018, more than 12,000 participants have completed the online course\u2014<a href=\"https://webaim.org/training/docs/\">Accessible Documents: Word, PowerPoint, &amp; Acrobat</a>. In 2020, WebAIM officially launched this program to enroll individuals with a disability in the course without cost.</p>\n\n<div class=\"goals\">\n\t<h2>This program has three goals:</h2>\n\t\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li>Providing job and professional skills to people with disabilities.</li>\n\t\t<li>Supporting WebAIM's mission to empower organizations and individuals to create accessible content.</li>\n\t\t<li>Increasing awareness of WebAIM's online training program.</li>\n\t</ol>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"course\">\n\t<h2>About the Online Course</h2>\n\t\n\t<p class=\"aboveList\">This course features 38 video-based learning activities with:</p>\n\t\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Multimedia transcripts</li>\n\t\t<li>Quizzes &amp; Exams</li>\n\t\t<li>Practice Files</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t\n\t<p>This is an independent-study course designed for adult learners that have experience creating Word &amp; PowerPoint documents. Each monthly course cohort is open for 60 working days (excludes weekends &amp; U.S. holidays) from the opening date.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"terms\">\n\t<h2>Apply</h2>\n\t\n<p class=\"aboveForm\">Complete the form below to apply (this form is optimized for the <a href=\"https://www.google.com/chrome/downloads/\">Chrome browser</a>). To qualify you must have a disability. You agree not to share your course access credentials with anyone else. Applicants under 18 years of age must have a parent or guardian complete an <a href=\"https://bit.ly/webaimscholarshipauthorization\">authorization form</a>.</p>\n\t\n\t<form action=\"https://api.sheetmonkey.io/form/tmFCkBeRLq4Pe3gZ1NCGCN\" method=\"POST\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"x-sheetmonkey-insert-data-top\" value=\"1\">\t\n\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"Submitted\" value=\"2026-03-28 05:58:53\" readonly=\"readonly\">\n\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"Invited\" value=\"-\">\n\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"Enrolled\" value=\"-\">\n\n\t\t<label for=\"first\">First name: <span>*</span></label>\n\t\t<input type=\"text\" id=\"first\" name=\"First\" class=\"form-control name_fname\" style=\"width:15em;\" required=\"\">\n\n\t\t<label for=\"last\">Last name: <span>*</span></label>\n\t\t<input type=\"text\" id=\"last\" name=\"Last\" class=\"form-control name_lname\" style=\"width:15em;\" required=\"\">\n\n\t\t<label for=\"email\">Email: <span>*</span></label>\n\t\t<input type=\"text\" id=\"email\" name=\"Email\" class=\"form-control name_email\" style=\"width:25em;\" required=\"\">\n\n\t\t<label for=\"about\">Please tell us a little bit about yourself and how taking WebAIM's Document Accessibility course will help you: <span>*</span></label>\n\t\t<textarea name=\"About\" id=\"about\" value=\"\" style=\"width:25em;height:5em;\" required=\"\"></textarea>\n\n\t\t<label for=\"learned\">Please share with us how you learned about the scholarship program: </label>\n\t\t<textarea name=\"Learned\" id=\"learned\" value=\"\" style=\"width:25em;height:5em;\"></textarea><br>\n\t\t\n\t\t<fieldset>\n\t\t\t<legend>Please indicate which cohort you want to join <span>*</span></legend>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" name=\"Cohort\" id=\"current\" value=\"Current\" checked=\"checked\"> <label class=\"normal\" for=\"current\">I want to join the current cohort.</label><br>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" name=\"Cohort\" id=\"next\" value=\"Next\"> <label class=\"normal\" for=\"next\">I want to join the next cohort (starts the first Monday of each month, unless U.S. holiday that week).</label><br>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\n\t\t<fieldset>\n\t\t\t<legend>Please indicate your disability status and agree to the course terms<span>*</span></legend>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"Disability\" id=\"discert\" value=\"Yes\" required=\"\"> <label class=\"normal\" for=\"discert\">I have a disability.</label><br>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"Terms\" id=\"termscert\" value=\"Yes\" required=\"\"> <label class=\"normal\" for=\"termscert\">I agree that I will not share my course login credentials with anyone else, or allow anyone else access to the course content.</label>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\n\t\t<input type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-success\" id=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\">\n\n\t</form>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div></article>\n<!--\n\t-->\n<aside id=\"articlemeta\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"related\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Related Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/training/docs/images/AD-scholarship-program-v1.pdf\">Scholarship Program flyer (pdf)</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n</aside>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n\t<div id=\"footerresources\">\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"copyright\">\u00a92026 WebAIM</h2>\n\t\t\t<p id=\"contact\">\t\t\tUtah State University<br>\n\t\t\t6807 Old Main Hill<br>\n\t\t\tLogan, UT 84322-6807<br>\n\t\t\t<a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:4357977024\">435.797.7024</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id=\"checkpage\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Check Your Accessibility</h2>\n\t\t\t<form action=\"https://wave.webaim.org/report\" novalidate=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<label for=\"waveurl\">Web site address:</label>\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"url\" id=\"waveurl\" name=\"url\" title=\"Web site address\">\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"submit\" value=\"WAVE\">\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"blog\">From the Blog</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul><li><a href=\"/blog/a-new-path/\">A New Path for Digital Accessibility?</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/2026-predictions/\">2026 Predictions: The Next Big Shifts in Web Accessibility</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/word-and-powerpoint-alt-text-roundup/\">Word and PowerPoint Alt Text Roundup</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/accessibility-by-design/\">Accessibility by Design: Preparing K\u201312 Schools for What\u2019s Next</a></li></ul>\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"popular\">Popular Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/training/\">WebAIM Training</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/standards/wcag/checklist\">WCAG 2 Checklist</a></li>\n\t